<title>JAPAN: Chichibu Onoda -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Chichibu Onoda -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		132.18		vs	  131.28</p>
<p> Operating     prft 4.16		vs   loss 965    million</p>
<p> Current		2.45		vs	  240    million</p>
<p> Net		    1.98		vs	    1.09</p>
<p> EPS		    3.43 yen	  vs	    1.89 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    577 million	  vs	 577 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Chichibu Onoda Cement Corp was formed on October 1, 1994 from a merger of Onoda Cement  Co Ltd and Chichibu Cement Co Ltd.</p>
